		"{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"Begin\",\"color\":\"#D6B879\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" at Y = -\"},{\"text\":\"60\",\"color\":\"#D6B879\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" or higher and remain at or below Y = \"},{\"text\":\"3200\",\"color\":\"#D6B879\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" when completing the ascent.\"}]}"
	]
