		"{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"Place a \"},{\"text\":\"Lightning Rod\",\"color\":\"#D6B879\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" on a \"},{\"text\":\"Block of Experience\",\"color\":\"#D6B879\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" under an open sky and let lightning strike it. Collect the resulting \"},{\"text\":\"Block of Super Experience\",\"color\":\"#D6B879\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\".\"}]}"
